Measured in k17 job 2 (2026-11-13). replace filter: ~80 µs per match on ASCII (20K matches 1.78 s, 80K 6.4 s), js_method_call ~24 µs vs 5 µs for the bare Lib seam; on astral strings quadratic (20K matches in a 60K-unit string 8.6 s string path, 7.5 s regex path). title ~100 µs per word. Cause: Lib unit conversion is O(n) per seam call. Not a fidelity issue; with k63/k25.
